Author: telecomadm1145 <47657299+telecomadm1145@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Mon Jun 15 01:02:43 2026 +0800

    feat: Detect screen size and persist debugger window state (#73)
    
    - Added `windowX`, `windowY`, `windowW`, and `windowH` to `ThemeSettings` for state persistence.
    - Updated `ThemeSettings::Read` and `ThemeSettings::Write` with backward compatibility checks (`stm.peek()`).
    - Updated `test_gui` to query display boundaries (`SDL_GetDisplayUsableBounds`) and initialize the window size/position, safely clamping them within the visible screen.
    - Updated `gui_cleanup` to fetch the final window coordinates (`SDL_GetWindowPosition`, `SDL_GetWindowSize`) and save them into `ThemeSettings` before shutdown.
    
