    Fix: Delay keyboard release by 25ms using SDL Timer (#58)
    
    Modified `CasioEmuMsvc/Peripheral/Keyboard.cpp` to ensure a key press
    is visually and logically held for at least 25ms. Uses `SDL_AddTimer`
    with a direct callback to defer the release action if the physical key
    was pressed for less than 25ms.
    
    Co-authored-by: google-labs-jules[bot] <161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>

