Date:   Sun May 17 16:41:51 2026 +0800

    🛡️ Sentinel: Fix Path Traversal (Zip Slip) in RomPackage.h (#53)
    
    Added an `isPathSafe` validator to `RomPackage::ExtractTo` to prevent paths containing `..` or absolute paths from being used during archive extraction. This prevents a classic Zip Slip vulnerability where a maliciously crafted package could write files outside the intended destination directory.
    
    Co-authored-by: google-labs-jules[bot] <161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>

