Author: telecomadm1145 <47657299+telecomadm1145@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Sat May 2 00:28:09 2026 +0800

    feat(android): Add background emulation notifications and timeout (#35)
    
    * Add POST_NOTIFICATIONS permission to AndroidManifest.xml for Android 13+.
    * In `Game.java`, create an "emu_channel" notification channel in `onCreate`.
    * Override `onPause` to display an ongoing background notification and post a 5-minute delayed `Runnable` via a `Handler`.
    * In `onResume`, cancel the background notification and remove the timeout callback.
    * If the timeout is reached while in the background, display a "Emulation Stopped" notification and exit the application cleanly.
    * Request POST_NOTIFICATIONS permission dynamically on `onResume` for Android 13+ devices.
    
    Co-authored-by: google-labs-jules[bot] <161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>

